# The root .gitignore drops every .env.* file. This one holds no secret: it only
# points the dev build at the Vite proxy. A cold clone needs it to start without
# CORS configuration, so keep it tracked.
!.env.development

# Playwright output. The spec is tracked; its reports and traces are not.
